  "name": "segment sagittal rotation vs trunk flexion",
  "definition": "Sagittal rotation relative to initial upright posture; trunk = T1 vs global, pelvis = S1 vs global, lumbar = T12 vs S1, upper thorax = T1 vs T5, lower thorax = T5 vs T12, total thorax = T1 vs T12; group mean curve at each 10% of each subject's full T1 flexion",
  "unit": "deg"
 },
 "source": {
  "short": "Hajibozorgi 2016",
  "authors": "Hajibozorgi M, Arjmand N",
  "year": 2016,
  "journal": "J Biomech 49(6):913-918",
  "doi": "10.1016/j.jbiomech.2015.09.003",
